EDIT 1 (the actual fix) — /workspace/src/util/time.ts, function `leveledFormat` (starts line 331), inside the `else if (zrUtil.isFunction(formatter))` branch at lines 343-347. Current code:
```ts
    else if (zrUtil.isFunction(formatter)) {
        const extra: TimeAxisLabelFormatterExtraParams = {
            time: tick.time,
            level: tick.time.level,
        };
```
Replace line 346 `            level: tick.time.level,` with `            level: tick.time ? tick.time.level : 0,`. Leave `time: tick.time` as-is (it becomes `undefined` for custom ticks, same as upstream). Nothing else in the function changes: the following `scaleBreakHelper.makeAxisLabelFormatterParamBreak(extra, tick.break)` (line 350) already tolerates an undefined `tick.break` (see /workspace/src/scale/breakImpl.ts lines 701-714), and `format(new Date(tick.value), template, isUTC, lang)` (line 367) passes the formatter's returned string through template replacement unchanged when it contains no `{...}` placeholders.

EDIT 2 (defensive, matches upstream apache/echarts PR #21352) — /workspace/src/scale/Time.ts, `getTicks()`, lines 206-211. Current code:
```ts
        let upperUnitIndex = primaryTimeUnits.length - 1;
        let maxLevel = 0;
        each(ticks, tick => {
            upperUnitIndex = Math.min(upperUnitIndex, indexOf(primaryTimeUnits, tick.time.upperTimeUnit));
            maxLevel = Math.max(maxLevel, tick.time.level);
        });
```
Wrap the loop body in a null check:
```ts
        each(ticks, tick => {
            if (tick.time) {
                upperUnitIndex = Math.min(upperUnitIndex, indexOf(primaryTimeUnits, tick.time.upperTimeUnit));
                maxLevel = Math.max(maxLevel, tick.time.level);
            }
        });
```
This is safe under this repo's tsconfig (no `strictNullChecks`; /workspace/tsconfig.json lines 3-7) even though `TimeScaleTick['time']` is declared required (/workspace/src/util/types.ts lines 540-562) — and ticks produced by `addBreaksToTicks` can legitimately carry `time: undefined` (/workspace/src/scale/breakImpl.ts lines 399-418).

